Kemarilah, hai, Sabi!

44
00:02:13.934 --> 00:02:15.102
Kata Kim, hey, kenapa awak macam ni?

45
00:02:15.169 --> 00:02:16.904
Hei, Sabi, hei

46
00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:19.734
[Nafas Sabi sesak nafas]

47
